      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3962917540685014439, guid: 67f4be0f82d90174ab4945173ce8636a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'sentences.Array.data[1]'
      value: If you are, try PRESSING LEFT CLICK, If you throw whatever you got on
        your person, It'll definitely scare them away
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3962917540685014439, guid: 67f4be0f82d90174ab4945173ce8636a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'sentences.Array.data[2]'
      value: If they get too close, you can JUMP AWAY WITH THE SPACE BAR.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3962917540685014439, guid: 67f4be0f82d90174ab4945173ce8636a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'sentences.Array.data[3]'
      value: It's either they possess you or you possess the courage to defeat them.
        Don't offer yourself up!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3962917540685014439, guid: 67f4be0f82d90174ab4945173ce8636a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'sentences.Array.data[4]'
      value: They may already have begun to take over your mind...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
